~ start
do Global.text_start.emit()
if Global.has_met_gun_guy:
	if not Global.has_gun:
		% John: Let me know when you find it
		% John: I swear it's somewhere near here!
		% John: Man, I'm in so much trouble!
	else:
		John: Hey! Have you found it yet?
		- I found you're gun. Here (give gun)
			John: No way! You're a real hero!
			John: I'll never forget this!
		- No I can't find it (keep the gun)
			John: Alright I guess it's time to confess to Sergeant
			John: Thanks for trying I guess.
else:
	if not Global.has_gun:
		John: Hey, thank god you're here! I lost something important and the old man's gonna chew me out for it!
		John: I lost my service pistol. Please help me find it. I could've swore it was somewhere near here!
		- What's in it for me?
			John: Well, I don't really have anything to give.
			John: It would just kinda be a nice thing you know?
			John: You would be my hero for sure though!
			- Yeah, I'm not doing it for free
				John: Fine! I'll just keep looking
				John: Man the Sergeant's gonna kill me!
				do Global.text_end.emit()
				set Global.has_met_gun_guy = true
				=> END!
			- Sure I'll try to find it for you
				John: Thanks, you're a life saver!
				do Global.text_end.emit()
				set Global.has_met_gun_guy = true
				=> END!
		- sure I'll help you find it.
			John: Thanks, you're a life saver!
			do Global.text_end.emit()
			set Global.has_met_gun_guy = true
			=> END!
		- Sorry can't right now.
			do Global.text_end.emit()
			=> END!

do Global.text_end.emit()
=> END